<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile revises lead offering.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile revises lead offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it has issued an amendment to the monthly offering of lead to update the listing of available material, to revise the payment provision to remove the option for payment by credit card, and to change some administrative details.</p>
<p>This amendment is effective for the next scheduled offering of lead on Thursday, July 3.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
